  "body_html": "<h1>naiveReverse</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ndef naiveReverse {A : Type} : List A → CostM ℕ (List A) | [] =&gt; pure [] | a :: as =&gt; do ✓[as.length + 1] do let rest ← naiveReverse as pure (rest ++ [a]) /-- Cumulative `++` allocation is quadratic in input length. -/</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>stdSimplex.pure</li>\n<li>Lottery.pure</li>\n</ul>",
